flowchart TB

PILLARS["`THREE PILLARS, THREE SEPARATE PIPELINES
metrics — the widest view
logs — the detailed view
traces — the full flow
each with its own storage`"]

APP["`API + WORKER
every process writes JSON,
one line per request, to stdout —
no files, no rotation
audit line per business action,
committed in the same transaction`"]

PROM["`PROMETHEUS — scrapes /metrics
Golden Signals: request rate,
error rate, latency
dependency state: PostgreSQL up, Redis up
Celery queue depth
LLM requests by provider and outcome`"]

RULES["`12 ALERT RULES — versioned in the repo
API down · error rate over 2% for 5 min
p95 over 1 s for 10 min vs the 545 ms
baseline (measured under load, not guessed)
dependencies down · queue stuck or growing
task failures after retries · all LLM
providers down · breaker open · disk
· memory · watchdog (fires always,
on purpose — it has no condition)
each rule carries a runbook annotation`"]

AM["`ALERTMANAGER
Prometheus detects, Alertmanager decides:
groups alerts, suppresses symptoms of an
already-reported failure, routes notifications
no receiver connected yet —
Slack is three steps in the runbook`"]

SLO["`FOUR SLOs — 30-day window
99% of requests without server errors
95% answered within 500 ms
95% of plans drafted within 2 min
under 5% of drafts failing
numbers that CAN be broken — an SLO
that can never be violated is not a goal`"]

TAIL["`PROMTAIL
small agent watching the Docker socket
autodiscovers containers — a new service
is collected with zero configuration`"]

LOKI["`LOKI — one line has everything:
method · route · status · latency · IP
· user agent · acting user · id · e-mail
· role · TRACE IDENTIFIER
one line per request, on purpose —
not one in and one out`"]

COL["`OTEL COLLECTOR
app sends OTLP to the Collector —
the tracing backend can be swapped
without touching application code`"]

TEMPO["`TEMPO — no published port,
deliberately: Grafana is the only
window into tracing
trace context propagated THROUGH the
Redis broker: the HTTP request and the
4.5 s background job are ONE story —
30 spans, two processes, one trace
the payoff: 93% of ingestion time was
the embedding call — a metric says
'4.5 s', a trace says WHERE they went`"]

GRAF["`GRAFANA — presents all three
dashboard 1: API golden signals + queues
dashboard 2: LLM — which provider answered,
which failed, whole chain down,
cost per user and per provider
both live in the repo as JSON`"]

CI["`VALIDATED IN CI
promtool check rules · amtool check config
· dashboards JSON — a broken rule lets
Prometheus start WITH NO ALERTS:
monitoring that looks healthy
but stopped working`"]

APP -.- PILLARS
APP -->|"/metrics"| PROM
PROM --> RULES --> AM
PROM -.- SLO
APP -->|"stdout"| TAIL --> LOKI
APP -->|"OTLP"| COL --> TEMPO
PROM --> GRAF
LOKI --> GRAF
TEMPO --> GRAF
RULES -.- CI
GRAF -.- CI

